<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1PE" style="id">- Aromanian Frasherot</book>
  <para style="h">1 Petru</para>
  <para style="toc1">Prota Epistolã al Petru</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Petru</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Pet</para>
  <para style="mt1">Prota Epistolã al Petru</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1PE 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 1:1" />Petru, apostul al Isus Hristos, atsilor tsi hits aleptsã sh-xenji tu diasporã tu Pontu, tu Galatia, tu Capadochia, tu Asia sh-tu Bitinia, <verse eid="1PE 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 1:2" />dupã pricunushtearea a Dumnidzãlui, Tatãlui, prit sãmtsãrea di la Duhlu, s-hibã ascultãtori al Isus Hristos sh-pruscutits cu sãndzili a lui:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 1:2">Harul sh-pacea s-vã si adavgã!<verse eid="1PE 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Alãvdarea a Dumnidzãlui di Nãdia atsea yii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 1:3" />Ghinicuvintat s-hibã Dumnidzãlu, Tatãl a Domnului a nostru Isus Hristos, tsi, dupã marea njila a lui nã amintã dinou la unã nãdii yii prit nyearea al Isus Hristos dit mortsã, <verse eid="1PE 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 1:4" />cãtrã mushtinirea niaspartã, nipãngãnitã sh-nimãrãnghisitã, tsi easti vigljeatã tu tseruri ti noi. <verse eid="1PE 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 1:5" />Voi hits vigljeats cu putearea a Dumnidzãlui prit pisti trã ascãparea tsi easti etimã trã dizvãliri tu chirolu di soni. <verse eid="1PE 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 1:6" />Trã aestã hãrsits-vã, cu tutã cã tora, prindi s-hits nvirinats di putsãn chiro cu soi di soi di cãrteari. <verse eid="1PE 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 1:7" />Ashãtsi prova a pistiljei a voastrã, tsi easti ma scumpu di furia tsi s-aspardzi, sh-macã easti provat prit foc, s-hibã trã alãvdari, mãriri sh-tinjii cãndu Isus Hristos va s-aspunã. <verse eid="1PE 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 1:8" />Cu tutã cã voi nu lu avets vidzutã, lu vrets. Voi nu lu videts tora atsel, ma-pistipsits la nãsu. Trã atsea voi vã hãrsits cu harauã nispusã sh-mãritã, <verse eid="1PE 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 1:9" />amintãnda nãetea a pistiljei a voastrã, ascãparea a suflitlor a voshtri. <verse eid="1PE 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 1:10" />Trã aestã ascãpari, cãftarã sh-ntribarã prufitsilji, tsi prufitipsirã trã harul tsi va s-yinea trã voi, <verse eid="1PE 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 1:11" />shi sitixirã s-afla chirolu sh-cunditsili tsi Duhlu a Hristolui eara tu nãshi lã spunea cãndu elu mãrtirsea di ma nãinti ti munduirili a Hristolui sh-ti mãririli tsi va yinea. <verse eid="1PE 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 1:12" />A prufitsilor lã si aspusi cã elji huzmitipsea nu ti nãshi, ma ti voi. Cãndu elji zbura ti lucrili tsi tora ma si aspunã a voauã di la elji tsi au predicat evanghelu prit Duhlu Sãmtu pitricut dit tser, trã aestã, sh-anghilji vor multu s-mutrescu atseli lucri.<verse eid="1PE 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">S-hii Sãmtu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 1:13" />Trã atsea, etimãsits-vã, s-hits limpidz shi nãdãits didip tu harul tsi va s-vã si da tu aspunearea al Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1PE 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 1:14" />Ca hilji cãndãrsits, nu vã dutsets dupã vrearili atseli uruti di ma nãinti cãndu earat tu nishtirea a voastrã. <verse eid="1PE 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 1:15" />Ashãtsi cum easti sãmtu atsel tsi vã acljimã, s-hits sh-voi sãmtsã tu purtarea a voastrã. <verse eid="1PE 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 1:16" />Cã easti scriat: “S-hits sãmtsã, cã mini escu sãmtu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:2">Lev 19:2</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 1:17" />Macã lu acljimats Tatã atsel tsi fãrã hãtãri giudicã dupã faptili a cathiunui, atumtsea tritsets ca xenji chirolu a vostru pri loc cu fricã. <verse eid="1PE 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 1:18" />Voi shtits, cã nu vã arãscumpãrat prit lucrili tsi s-aspargu ca asimea sh-furia, di bana atsea digeaba tsi mushtinatã di la ntãnjilji, <verse eid="1PE 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 1:19" />ma cu sãndzili atsel scumpul al Hristos, ca Njelu fãrã cusuri sh-fãrã lãvushiturã. <verse eid="1PE 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 1:20" />Elu eara aleapt ma nãinti di adrarea a lumiljei, ma aspus tu chirolu di soni trã voi. <verse eid="1PE 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 1:21" />Prit nãsu s-pistipsits la Dumnidzãlu, tsi lu nyie dit mortsã sh-lu multumãri tsi pistea sh-nãdia a voastrã s-hibã la Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="1PE 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 1:22" />Tora voi avets curat suflitli a voastri prit cãndãrsirea a alihiljei, tsi s-avets vreari frãtseascã fãrã ipucrizii, s-vã vrets multu cu un-alantu sh-cu inima curatã. <verse eid="1PE 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 1:23" />Voi hits amintat nu di unã simintsã tsi s-aspardzi, ma di unã simintsã tsi nu s-aspardzi, prit zborlu atsel yiulu al Dumnidzãu tsi armãni di totãna. <verse eid="1PE 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 1:24" />Cã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">“Cathi om easti ca iarba,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">sh-cathi mãriri a omlui easti ca lilicea a iarbãljei.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 1:24">Iarba s-usucã sh-lilicea cadi,<verse eid="1PE 1:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 1:25" />ma zborlu a Domnului armãni di totãna.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-8">Isa 40:6-8</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 1:25">Aestu easti zborlu, tsi easti ghini-hãbãrsitã a voauã.<verse eid="1PE 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1PE 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 2:1" />Trã atsea, arucats nclo itsi arãutati, itsi arãdeari, itsi ipucrizii, itsi zilii sh-itsi cacuzburãri. <verse eid="1PE 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 2:2" />Ca ficiuritslji di macãt-amintats, s-vrets laptili atsel curatu sh-suflitescu, tra s-vã crishtets tu ascãparea a voastrã, <verse eid="1PE 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 2:3" />macã dealihea avets gustat, cã Domnul easti bun.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:8">Ps 34:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cheatra Atsea Yii sh-Populu Atsel Aleptu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 2:4" />Aprucheats-vã la nãsu, tsi easti cheatrã yii, arnisitã di oaminjlji, ma aleaptã sh-custusit nãintea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1PE 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 2:5" />Sh-voi, ca chetsri yii, vã-adrats ca unã casã sufliteascã, s-hits priftsami sãmtã, tsi s-lã aprucheats curbãnji sufliteascã, arsitã a Dumnidzãlui prit Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1PE 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 2:6" />Cã s-dzãtsi tu Scriturã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:6">“Ia, ma bagã tu Sion unã cheatrã di chiushei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">aleaptã shi scumpã, sh-atsel tsi pistipseashti la nãsu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:6">nu va s-arushineadzã dip.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Isa 28:16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 2:7" />Trã voi tsi pistipsits, atsea easti scumpã, ma trã atselji tsi nu pistipsescu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:7">“Cheatra arnisitã di masturlji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:7">atsea s-featsi cheatra a chioshlui.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ps 118:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 2:8" />Shi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 2:8">“Cheatrã di nchidicari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 2:8">sh-cheatrã di cãdeari.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:14-15">Isa 8:14-15</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="m" vid="1PE 2:8">Elji s-ncheadicã cã nu ascultã la zborlu, sh-trã aestã elji eara arãdãpsitsã.<verse eid="1PE 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 2:9" />Ma voi hits popul aleptu, priftsami amirãreascã, farã sãmtã, popul a lui aleptu di la Dumnidzãlu, tsi s-dimãndats mãrirea atsilui, tsi vã acljimã di ntunearic tu lunjina a lui atsea thãvmãtusita. <verse eid="1PE 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 2:10" />Voi tsi vãrãoarã nu earat popul, iarã tora hits populu al Dumnidzãu, vãrãoarã earat ninjiluits, ma tora njiluits.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:23">Hos 2:23</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">S-Bãnedz unã Banã Dumnidzãsitã tu unã Dunjauã Pãngãnã</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 2:11" />Multu-vruts, vã fac rigeai, ca xenji sh-ca cãlãtori, s-vã afirits di orixili atseali trupeshti, tsi alumtã contra a suflitlui. <verse eid="1PE 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 2:12" />Spunets-vã bunji namisa di pãngãnjlji, tsi sh-macã elji zburãscu arãu trã voi, s-veadã faptili a voastri atseali buni shi s-multumãreascã Dumnidzãlu tu atsea dzuã tsi va yinã. <verse eid="1PE 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 2:13" />Sumbãgats-vã trã hãtãrea a Domnului la itsi puteari umineascã: ashã di cum a amirãlui ca ma analtu autoritati, <verse eid="1PE 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 2:14" />ashãtsi sh-a-guvernatorilor, ca pitricuts di la amirãlu trã cãtãdzicãsiri arãlji sh-trã alãvdari atselji tsi fac ghini. <verse eid="1PE 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 2:15" />Cã aestã easti vrearea a Dumnidzãlui, tsi voi fãcãnda ghini si ncljidets gura a nishtiriljei a oaminjlor fãrã minti. <verse eid="1PE 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 2:16" />Bãnats ca oaminji liberi, ma nu ufilisits libertatea ca nvãliturã di anvãliri arãutatea, ma ca sclayi al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1PE 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 2:17" />Tinjisits-lã tuts, s-vrets frãtsiljea, s-avets frica a Dumnidzãlui, tinjisits amirãlu!<verse eid="1PE 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 2:18" />Voi sclayi, sumbãgats-vã a domnjilor a voshtri cu fricã, nu mash a bunjilor sh-a moljilor, ma sh-a capriciosilor. <verse eid="1PE 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 2:19" />Easti trã alãvdari, macã vãrã aravdã durearili di munduirili nindriptati cu conshtintsã trã Dumnidzãlu. <verse eid="1PE 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 2:20" />Tsi alãvdari va hibã ma s-arãvdats bãterili dupã tsi avets amãrtisitã? Ma, ma s-arãvdats munduirili ti ghinili tsi fãtsets, aestã lj-arseashti a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1PE 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 2:21" />Cã trã aestã hits acljimats, cã sh-Hristolu trapsi trã voi, alãsãnda a voauã un exemplu, tsi voi s-imnats dupã urmili a lui. <verse eid="1PE 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 2:22" />Elu nu featsi vãrã amãrtii, sh-nu s-aflã nitsiun arãdeari tu gura a lui.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:9">Isa 53:9</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1PE 2:23" />Cãndu lu pizuirã, nu apãndisea. Cãndu s-munduia, nu cãnusea, ma lji si pridãdea Atsilui tsi giudicã cu ndriptati.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Isa 53:7</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1PE 2:24" />Elu li purtã amãrtiili a noastri tu truplu a lui pri lemnul a crutsiljei, tsi noi mortsã trã amãrtii s-bãnãm cu ndriptati, “sh-prit pledzili a lui voi vã vindicat.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:5">Isa 53:5</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1PE 2:25" />Cã “voi earat ca oi tsi au chirut calea,” ma tora voi vã turnat la Picurarlu sh-la Vigljitorlu a suflitlor a voastri.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:6">Isa 53:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1PE 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 3:1" />Tutashã, sh-voi muljeri, sumbãgats-vã a bãrbatslor a voshtri. Sh-macã niscãntsã nu pistipsescu la zborlu a Dumnidzãlui, s-hibã amintati fãrã zboari prit purtarea a muljerilor a lor, <verse eid="1PE 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 3:2" />cãndu s-veadã purtarea a voastrã curatã sh-cu rispectã. <verse eid="1PE 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 3:3" />Stulida a voastrã s-nu hibã ti videari: perlu cusitsã-adãrat, stulii di furii spindzurati sh-nvishtearea cu stranji scumpi. <verse eid="1PE 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 3:4" />Ma omlu atsel ascumtu a inimãljei s-hibã stulia niaspartã a unui duh moali sh-isih, tsi easti axiusit nãintea al Dumnidzãu. <verse eid="1PE 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 3:5" />Cã ashãtsi si stulisea vãrãoarã sh-muljerili atseali sãmti, tsi nãdãea tu Dumnidzã, hiinda sumbãgati a bãrbatslor a lor, <verse eid="1PE 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 3:6" />ashãtsi ca Sara, cai asculta Abrahamul sh-lu acljima “domnu”. Voi hits hiljilji a ljei, macã fãtsets ghini sh-nu vã aspãrats di tsiva.<verse eid="1PE 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 3:7" />Tutashã sh-voi, bãrbats s-bãnats cu mintimenilji cu muljerili a voastri, cã truplu a lor easti ma slabã. Tinjisits-lã, cã eali deadun cu voi suntu mushtinitoari a harului a banãljei, tra s-nu si ncheadicã rugãciunjili a voastri.<verse eid="1PE 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Munduirea ti Fãtseari Ghini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 3:8" />Tu soni, s-hits tuts pi unã minti, duruts, cu vreari frãtseascã, njilãoshi sh-aplicats. <verse eid="1PE 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 3:9" />Nu turnats arãulu cu arãu, icã ngiurarea cu ngiurari, di contra ghinicuvintats, shtinda cã ti aestã fut acljimat, tsi s-mushtinits ghinicuvintarea. <verse eid="1PE 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 3:10" />Cã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">“Cai va u-va bana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">sh-va veadã dzãli buni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 3:10">s-u tsãnã limba a lui di arãulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:10">sh-budzãli a lui di grailu arãdios.<verse eid="1PE 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 3:11" />Si s-dipãrteadzã di arãulu shi s-facã ghinetsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:11">s-caftã pacea shi s-imnã dupã ea.<verse eid="1PE 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 3:12" />Cã ocljilji a Domnului suntu pristi ndreptsãlji,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">urecljili a lui suntu cãtrã rugãciunjili a lor,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 3:12">iarã-fatsa a Domnului easti contra atsilor tsi fac arãu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 34:12-16">Ps 34:12-16</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 3:13" />Cai va s-vã fac arãu, macã voi avets vreari di ghineatsã? <verse eid="1PE 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 3:14" />Ma, sh-macã vã munduits di ndriptatea, cahara di voi! “S-nu avets fricã di cãnusirili a lor, sh-nu vã tulburats.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:12">Isa 8:12</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="1PE 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 3:15" />Ma sãmtsãsits-lu Domnul Hristos tu ininjli a voastri. Shi s-hits totãna etinji tra s-lji apãndisits a cuitsido tsi vã caftã itii trã nãdia tsi voi avets. <verse eid="1PE 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 3:16" />Fãtsets-u aestã cu muljeatsã sh-cu rispect, avãnda conshtintsã curatã, tsi atselji tsi vã zburãscu arãu trã purtarea a voastrã atsea buna tu Hristolu, s-arushineadzã. <verse eid="1PE 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 3:17" />Cã easti ma ghini, macã easti ahtar vrearea a Dumnidzãlui, s-vã munduits fãcãnda ghini, dicãt fãcãnda arãu. <verse eid="1PE 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 3:18" />Cã sh-Hristolu s-mundui unãoarã ti amãrtiili, ndreptul di nindreptsãlji, tra s-vã aduc la Dumnidzãlu. S-vãtãmã tu trup ma s-nyie tu Duh. <verse eid="1PE 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 3:19" />Ashã elu s-dusi s-preadicã a duhurilor cai eara tu hapsi, <verse eid="1PE 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1PE 3:20" />tsi vãrãoarã nu asculta, cãndu Dumnidzãlu lji ashtipta cu arãvdari tu dzãlili al Noe, iarã s-adra arca. Putsãnji di elji ascãparã prit apã, mash optu sufliti. <verse eid="1PE 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1PE 3:21" />Aestã apã easti videala di azã a pitedzlui – nu easti ashtirdzearea a lãvushiturilor a truplui, ma cãftarea trã unã conshtintsã bunã cãtrã Dumnidzãlu – tsi vã ascapã voi prit nyearea al Isus Hristos. <verse eid="1PE 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1PE 3:22" />Elu s-anãltsã tu tser shi sheadi tu nandreapta a Dumnidzãlui, shi domneashti anghilji, puterili sh-fuchiili.<verse eid="1PE 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1PE 4" />
  <para style="s1">Bãnari trã Dumnidzãlu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 4:1" />Trã atsea, metsi Hristolu s-mundui trã noi cu truplu a lui, armãtuits-vã sh-voi cu idyia minduiri, cã atsel cai s-ari munduit tu trup, ascãpã s-amãrtiseascã, <verse eid="1PE 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 4:2" />tra s-bãnats chirolu tsi vã armãni tu trup nu dupã mirãchili a oaminjlor ma dupã vrearea a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1PE 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 4:3" />Trã voi easti nimal chirolu a banãljei tsi tricu trã fãtseari lucrili a pãngãnjilor, imnãnda tu disfãrnari, tu orixi, tu mbitari, tu uspetsi mãri, sh-tu adunari trã mbitari sh-tu idulatrii cacurishti. <verse eid="1PE 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 4:4" />Trã atsea, a lor lã-si pari ti ciudii cã voi nu alãgats ma cu nãshi tu disfãrnãrili a lor, sh-trã atsea vã ngiurã. <verse eid="1PE 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 4:5" />Elji va da lugurii nãintea atsilui tsi easti etimu s-giudicã yiilji sh-mortsãlji. <verse eid="1PE 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 4:6" />Trã aestã, evanghelu s-dimãndã sh-atsilor tsi tora suntu mortsã, tsi elji s-giudicã tu trup ca dupã oaminjlji, ma s-bãneadzã tu duh ca dupã Dumnidzãlu.<verse eid="1PE 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 4:7" />Bitisirea a tutulor easti aproapi. S-hits froninji sh-sirinj shi angajats-vã a rugãciunjilor. <verse eid="1PE 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 4:8" />Pristi tuti, s-avets unã vreari mari trã un-alantu, cã vrearea va s-anvãleascã unã multsãmi di amãrtii. <verse eid="1PE 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 4:9" />S-hits oaspitori cu un-alantu fãrã murmurari. <verse eid="1PE 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 4:10" />Cathiun di voi s-u mpartã cu alantu doara tsi ari loatã ca icunomi bunji a harului di multi soi a Dumnidzãlui. <verse eid="1PE 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 4:11" />Macã vãrã zburashti, s-u facã aestã ca predicarea a Dumnidzãlui. Cai fatsi un huzmitipsiri, s-u facã cu putearea tsi lji da Dumnidzãlu, tsi tu itsido s-multumãreascã Dumnidzãlu prit Isus Hristos, a cui lji easti mãrirea sh-putearea tu eta a etilor. Amin!<verse eid="1PE 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 4:12" />Multu-vruts, nu vã ciudisits di prova a foclui tsi s-apreasi pri voi, sh-cum vã featsi tsiva ti ciudii. <verse eid="1PE 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 4:13" />Ma hãrsits-vã tsi hits parti tu munduirili a Hristolui, tsi sh-la discupirirea a mãririljei a lui s-putets s-vã hãrsits shi s-hits hãroshi. <verse eid="1PE 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 4:14" />Macã vã ngiurã trã numa a Hristolui, cahara di voi, cã Duhlu a mãririljei sh-Duhlu a Dumnidzãlui s-discurmã pristi voi. <verse eid="1PE 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1PE 4:15" />Vãrã di voi s-nu s-mundueascã ca vãtãmãtor, icã ca fur, icã ca fãcãtor di arali, icã tsi s-minteashti tu lucrili a alantsãlor. <verse eid="1PE 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1PE 4:16" />Macã vãrã s-mundueashti ca Crishtin, s-nu aibã arushãni, ma s-alavdã Dumnidzãlu tsi tsãni aestã numã. <verse eid="1PE 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1PE 4:17" />Cã vini chirolu tsi s-ahurheascã giudicata di la casa a Dumnidzãlui. Sh-macã ahurheashti ma nãinti di la noi, cum va hibã bitisita atsilor tsi nu ascultã evanghelu a Dumnidzãlui? <verse eid="1PE 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1PE 4:18" />Shi:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 4:18">“Macã ndreptul cu zori ascapã,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 4:18">tsi va s-undzeascã cu nipistimenlu shi amãrtioslu?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Prov 11:31.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1PE 4:19" />Trã atsea, sh-atselji tsi s-munduescu dupã vrearea a Dumnidzãlui, si l-pistipseascã a lui suflitli a lor a Fãcãtorlui pistimen, fãcãnda ma buna.<verse eid="1PE 4:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1PE 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nvitsãturili trã Aushlji sh-trã Tinirlji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1PE 5:1" />Lã fac rigeai a aushlor cai suntu tu mesea a voastrã, mini cai escu aush ca voi, martir a munduirilor al Hristos sh-acljimat la mãrirea tsi va s-dizvãleascã unã dzuã. <verse eid="1PE 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1PE 5:2" />Vigljeats cupia a Dumnidzãlui, tsi vã easti pistipsitã a voauã, vigljiãnda nu cu zori, ma cu vreari, nu ti amintatic nitinjisitã, ma cu vreari bunã. <verse eid="1PE 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1PE 5:3" />Nu vã spunets ca domnji pri atselji tsi vã suntu pistipsitã, ma s-hits ca exemplu trã cupia. <verse eid="1PE 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1PE 5:4" />Sh-cãndu s-aspunã Marlu Picurar, va loats curuna a mãririljei tsi nu s-usucã.<verse eid="1PE 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1PE 5:5" />Tutashã, voi tiniri sumbãgats-vã a aushlor. Tuts trã un-alantu nvishtets-vã cu aplicãciuni, cã:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1PE 5:5">“Dumnidzãlu lã ncuntreadzã fudulji</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1PE 5:5">sh-lã da har a aplicatsilji.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false">Prov 3:34.</char></note><verse eid="1PE 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1PE 5:6" />Trã atsea, aplicats-vã sum mãna atsea vãrtoasa a Dumnidzãlui, tsi elu s-vã analtsã tu chirolu tsi prindi. <verse eid="1PE 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1PE 5:7" />Alãsats tuti mirãchili a voastri tu mãna a lui, cã elu ari angãtan ti voi.<verse eid="1PE 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1PE 5:8" />S-hits dishtiptat sh-vigljeats! Neamiclu a vostru, draclu, yini anvãrliga ca un ljundar tsi aurlã, cãftãnda cã cai s-mãcã. <verse eid="1PE 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1PE 5:9" />Ncuntrats atsilui, niminat tu pisti. Prindi s-shtits cã idyili munduiri ma li tragã sh-fratslji a voshtri arãspãndits tu lumi.<verse eid="1PE 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1PE 5:10" />Dupã tsi s-avets traptã di putsãn chiro, Dumnidzãlu a caitsido har, tsi vã acljimã tu mãrirea a lui di totãna tu Hristolu, elu va vã perfectsioneadzã, va vã andoapirã, va vã nvãrtusheadzã sh-va vã thimiljeadzã. <verse eid="1PE 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1PE 5:11" />A lui s-lji hibã putearea tu eta a etilor. Amin!<verse eid="1PE 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Salutãrili di Soni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1PE 5:12" />Vã scriai shcurtu prit Silvanlu, cai lu tinjisescu ca fratili atsel-pistimenlu, tra s-vã inimusimu shi s-vã mãrtirsimu cã harul atsel-alihioslu a Dumnidzãlui easti aestu, la cai voi stats. <verse eid="1PE 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1PE 5:13" />Bisearica tsi easti tu Babilonii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">zborlu easti trã bisearica tsi s-afla Roma</char></note>, tsi easti aleaptã deadun cu voi, vã da sãnãtati. Tutashã sh-Marcu, hiljiu a meu vã pitreatsi sãnãtati.<verse eid="1PE 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1PE 5:14" />Salutats-vã cu un-alantu cu un sãmtã bãshari.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1PE 5:14">Pacea s-hibã pri voi tuts tsi hits tu Hristolu!<verse eid="1PE 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1PE 5" />
</usx>